/// @description Key F7 - toggle the heart
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// EVENT : Key Press, key code 118 = F7. Also tapped by the Heart button in Draw_64.
// DOES  : flips showHeart between 0 and 1. Draw_0 draws the heart while it is 1.
//         Cosmetic only; nothing else reads it.
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
showHeart=1-showHeart